<h2>Metrics → MetricsPlugin</h2>
<p>The core still exposes <code>getMetrics()</code>, but counters stay at zero without the plugin. <code>onRetryProcessFinished</code> remains a core lifecycle event but no longer carries a metrics payload — use <code>onMetricsUpdated</code> with <code>MetricsPlugin</code> when you need snapshots.</p>

