<h2>maxRefreshAttempts off-by-one fix</h2>
<p>In 1.x, <code>maxRefreshAttempts: 3</code> produced 4 total attempts due to a loop bug. In 2.0 it means exactly 3.</p>

<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode6} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Constructor <code>hooks</code> removed</h2>
<p>In 2.0, <code>RetryManagerOptions.hooks</code> is gone. Register core and plugin listeners with <code>retryer.on(...)</code> on the instance (after <code>use()</code> when the event is plugin-specific).</p>

<h2>Plugin event typing</h2>
<p>Plugin-specific events are typed on the manager returned from <code>use()</code>. You can pass a generic to <code>createRetryer&lt;Events&gt;()</code> for early core listeners, but plugin events are still registered with <code>.on()</code> after attaching the plugin.</p>

