<h2>Caching invalidation</h2>
<p><code>CachingPlugin.invalidateCache()</code> uses explicit semantics: a bare string matches the <strong>exact</strong> cache key (not a substring). Prefer <code>exact</code> / <code>prefix</code> object matchers or a <code>RegExp</code> (see example below).</p>
